{"seq":3,"slug":"loss-ratio-abnormal-tolerance-audit","title":"损耗率异常的识别与偏差容差稽核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/processing-trade-bonded-manual-bom/unit-consumption-loss/loss-ratio-abnormal-tolerance-audit","wordCount":2993,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"损耗率异常的识别与偏差容差稽核\">损耗率异常的识别与偏差容差稽核</h1><p>一家东莞五金厂在 H2018 手册报核时被退了单：同一本手册里，冲压成品的铜料损耗率在三个月内从 4.1% 跳到 9.8%，系统按备案单耗算出的理论耗料比实际进口料件少了近 12 吨。企业的第一反应是「盘点错了」，但盘点复核后数字没错——真正的问题是<strong>损耗率的异常没有被及时识别，等到报核才暴露</strong>。损耗率天然会波动，但并非所有波动都等价：源自工艺随机性的正常波动应当被容忍，而源自口径错配、台账断链或人为调账的异常必须被拦下。本文给出损耗率异常的识别方法、偏差容差的分层设定，以及把二者串成稽核闭环的工程做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-损耗率波动的三类变异来源\">核心概念：损耗率波动的三类变异来源</h2><p>损耗率的定义本身很简单，是工艺损耗占单耗的比重：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mi>U</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><mi>U</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = \\frac{L}{U} = \\frac{U - N}{U} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为工艺损耗、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为净耗、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 为单耗（三者关系与口径边界见 <a href=\"unit-consumption-definition-calculation\">单耗定义、净耗与工艺损耗的计算模型</a>）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 的比值，因此它的波动可能来自分子、分母或两者，识别异常的第一步是把变异的<strong>来源</strong>分类，否则会把「记录错」当成「工艺坏」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变异类型</th>\n<th>典型成因</th>\n<th>是否可容忍</th>\n<th>处置方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>随机变异</strong></td>\n<td>料件批差、环境温湿度、设备正常磨损</td>\n<td>可容忍（落在容差内）</td>\n<td>无需动作，纳入基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>系统性漂移</strong></td>\n<td>模具磨损加剧、工艺参数缓慢偏移、料件供应商变更</td>\n<td>需关注</td>\n<td>查工艺、必要时变更单耗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>阶跃跳变</strong></td>\n<td>工艺改版、设备更换、计量单位口径切换</td>\n<td>需解释</td>\n<td>触发单耗变更或口径核对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>口径/记录异常</strong></td>\n<td>台账与 ERP 断链、归并口径不一致、人为调账、跨手册串料</td>\n<td><strong>不可容忍</strong></td>\n<td>立即阻断，回溯原始工单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前三类是<strong>工艺事实</strong>，第四类是<strong>数据事实</strong>。工程上最贵的错误是把第四类当成第一类处理——用「正常波动」把一次台账断链解释掉，缺口留到报核时集中爆发，此时既无原始工单可复现，也无法证明损耗的合理性。因此识别算法的第一层不是看损耗率高低，而是先确认这条损耗率背后的<strong>取数链路是否闭合</strong>：料件领用明细、成品产出记录、报废工单三者能否勾稽到同一批号。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[采集损耗率样本&lt;br/&gt;按成品-料件对-批号] --&gt; B{取数链路是否闭合}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[标记口径异常&lt;br/&gt;阻断并回溯工单]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D{与基线比较&lt;br/&gt;计算偏差 d}&#10;  D --&gt;|d 在容差内| E[正常波动&lt;br/&gt;更新基线样本]&#10;  D --&gt;|d 超出内控容差| F[触发调查&lt;br/&gt;区分漂移/跳变]&#10;  D --&gt;|d 超出合规容差| G[触发举证与单耗变更]&#10;  F --&gt; H[查工艺参数 / 料件批号 / 计量口径]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[形成处置结论与证据]\">graph TD\n  A[采集损耗率样本&lt;br/&gt;按成品-料件对-批号] --&gt; B{取数链路是否闭合}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[标记口径异常&lt;br/&gt;阻断并回溯工单]\n  B --&gt;|是| D{与基线比较&lt;br/&gt;计算偏差 d}\n  D --&gt;|d 在容差内| E[正常波动&lt;br/&gt;更新基线样本]\n  D --&gt;|d 超出内控容差| F[触发调查&lt;br/&gt;区分漂移/跳变]\n  D --&gt;|d 超出合规容差| G[触发举证与单耗变更]\n  F --&gt; H[查工艺参数 / 料件批号 / 计量口径]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[形成处置结论与证据]</pre><h2 id=\"异常识别的统计工具-从阈值告警到控制图\">异常识别的统计工具：从阈值告警到控制图</h2><p>识别损耗率异常有三档由粗到精的方法，选择哪一档取决于数据的密度与业务的容错空间。</p>\n<p><strong>单阈值告警</strong>是最低档：给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 设一个绝对上限（例如行业单耗标准对应的损耗率），越限即告警。它的优点是实现廉价、口径清晰，缺点是只能在异常<strong>已经很大</strong>时才发现，且对「缓慢漂移」几乎无感——铜料损耗率每月涨 0.5%，五个月后才越限，此时已经侵蚀了大量料件。行业单耗标准作为备案上限的地位见 <a href=\"unit-consumption-filing-standard-declare\">单耗备案、申报口径与行业单耗标准</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>相对偏差</strong>是中间档，把损耗率与一条<strong>动态基线</strong>比较，而非固定的绝对上限：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>η</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = \\frac{\\eta*{actual} - \\eta*{baseline}}{\\eta\\_{baseline}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3674em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>基线可以取近 N 批次的滑动均值或工艺定额值。相对偏差的好处是自动适配不同成品、不同料件的量级——贵金属的损耗率基线与普通塑料件本就不同量级，用同一个绝对阈值必然误报。</p>\n<p><strong>控制图与变点检测</strong>是最高档，适合数据密度高的产线。常用的是 Shewhart 控制图（以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 3\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 为控制限）与 CUSUM（累积和）检测：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>η</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C*k = \\sum*{i=1}^{k} (\\eta_i - \\bar{\\eta})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>η</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{\\eta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7622em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为基线均值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 为标准差。Shewhart 图对<strong>单点越限</strong>（阶跃跳变）敏感，而 CUSUM 对<strong>持续的小幅偏移</strong>（系统性漂移）敏感——这正是铜料案例的失效模式：单点看每一批都「勉强正常」，累积和却早已越界。工程实践中两者常并用，形成互补。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>敏感对象</th>\n<th>数据要求</th>\n<th>误报风险</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单阈值告警</td>\n<td>大幅越限</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低（但漏报漂移）</td>\n<td>数据稀疏、监管口径告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相对偏差</td>\n<td>中幅偏离基线</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>多成品多料件的通用稽核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shewhart 控制图</td>\n<td>单点阶跃</td>\n<td>高（≥20 点）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>稳定产线、单一批次监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CUSUM 变点检测</td>\n<td>缓慢漂移</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>长周期趋势、模具磨损类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条落地建议：把「数据密度」当作方法选择的第一判据。批次数据只有个位数时硬上控制图，会因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 估计不稳而频繁误报，反而让稽核人员对告警脱敏——<strong>告警疲劳是异常识别系统最常见的死因</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"偏差容差的三层设定与稽核判定\">偏差容差的三层设定与稽核判定</h2><p>容差是「允许偏离多少不加处置」的边界。损耗率之所以需要容差而非零容忍，是因为随机变异客观存在，把每一点波动都当作异常会让稽核淹没在噪声里。工程上把容差分成三层，各自触发不同的动作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>容差层</th>\n<th>定义依据</th>\n<th>触发动作</th>\n<th>责任方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>工艺容差</strong></td>\n<td>产线历史波动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm k\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>（常用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>无动作，样本回流基线</td>\n<td>工艺部门</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>内控容差</strong></td>\n<td>企业内控目标（如相对偏差 ≤ 15%）</td>\n<td>触发调查、要求工艺说明</td>\n<td>关务 + 工艺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>合规容差</strong></td>\n<td>行业单耗标准或主管海关认可口径</td>\n<td>触发举证、单耗变更或补税</td>\n<td>关务主导</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三层容差是<strong>嵌套</strong>的：工艺容差 ⊂ 内控容差 ⊂ 合规容差。内层越限只惊动产线，中层越限惊动关务，外层越限才上升到监管沟通。这样分层的好处是稽核资源按风险投放，而不是平均用力。</p>\n<p>容差不是拍脑袋定的常数，它应当<strong>可溯源、可版本化</strong>。合规容差尤其如此——它是与行业单耗标准、主管海关口径绑定的值，标准更新或海关口径调整时，容差必须同步复算。把容差硬编码在一段判断逻辑里（<code>if (lossRate &gt; 0.15) ...</code>）是这类系统最典型的技术债：标准一变，散落各处的阈值没人能全找出来。</p>\n<p>浮点比较是另一个隐蔽陷阱。损耗率是比率，用浮点数存储时 <code>0.1 + 0.2 != 0.3</code>，直接做 <code>actual &lt;= tolerance</code> 的相等判断会在边界批次上随机漏判或误判。工程做法是固定小数精度做定点比较，或比较时引入一个显式 epsilon：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>η</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>判定为「贴边」, 标记人工复核</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\eta*{actual} - \\eta*{upper}| &lt; \\varepsilon \\Rightarrow \\text{判定为「贴边」, 标记人工复核}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6597em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">判定为「贴边」</span><span class=\"mord\">, </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">标记人工复核</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>「贴边」样本既不算越限也不算安全，标记出来交人工，比让算法在边界上抖动更可靠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异常处置与证据链-四条处置路径\">异常处置与证据链：四条处置路径</h2><p>识别出异常之后，处置动作必须与异常<strong>来源</strong>对应，否则会做出错误修正。四条路径分别对应前述四类变异：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  X[已判定异常] --&gt; T{异常分类}&#10;  T --&gt;|随机变异越限| P1[复核基线&lt;br/&gt;样本量是否足够]&#10;  T --&gt;|系统性漂移| P2[查工艺参数与模具&lt;br/&gt;评估是否需变更单耗]&#10;  T --&gt;|阶跃跳变| P3[核对工艺改版/设备变更&lt;br/&gt;走单耗变更流程]&#10;  T --&gt;|口径/记录异常| P4[阻断报核&lt;br/&gt;回溯原始工单与账册]&#10;  P2 --&gt; R[更新基线 + 记录处置结论]&#10;  P3 --&gt; R&#10;  P4 --&gt; R&#10;  P1 --&gt; R&#10;  R --&gt; S[证据归档&lt;br/&gt;与单耗版本绑定]\">graph TD\n  X[已判定异常] --&gt; T{异常分类}\n  T --&gt;|随机变异越限| P1[复核基线&lt;br/&gt;样本量是否足够]\n  T --&gt;|系统性漂移| P2[查工艺参数与模具&lt;br/&gt;评估是否需变更单耗]\n  T --&gt;|阶跃跳变| P3[核对工艺改版/设备变更&lt;br/&gt;走单耗变更流程]\n  T --&gt;|口径/记录异常| P4[阻断报核&lt;br/&gt;回溯原始工单与账册]\n  P2 --&gt; R[更新基线 + 记录处置结论]\n  P3 --&gt; R\n  P4 --&gt; R\n  P1 --&gt; R\n  R --&gt; S[证据归档&lt;br/&gt;与单耗版本绑定]</pre><p>四条路径里，只有<strong>口径/记录异常</strong>需要阻断业务流——因为它的后果是核销数据本身不可信，继续流转只会把错误放大到报核阶段。其余三条都是工艺范畴的调整，可以在不影响进出口流转的前提下处理。</p>\n<p>处置的关键产物是<strong>证据链</strong>。海关稽查关注的从来不是「损耗率是不是 9.8%」，而是「这个 9.8% 是怎么来的、能不能复现」。因此每一次异常处置都要落地三样东西：异常发生时的原始数据（批次、工单、领料明细）、判定所依据的基线与容差版本、处置结论及其支撑材料（工艺说明、检测报告、变更记录）。这三样必须与当时的<strong>单耗版本</strong>绑定——如果只存一个处置结论而不存它对应的数据快照，半年后稽查来问，企业将无法还原当时的判定依据。这与单耗模型「带版本、可溯源」的设计要求是同一条主线的两端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与海关稽查的对接与自查\">与海关稽查的对接与自查</h2><p>损耗率异常在监管视角下的意义，是它可能构成<strong>申报不实</strong>的线索。依据《中华人民共和国海关加工贸易单耗管理办法》（海关总署令第155号）与《中华人民共和国海关加工贸易货物监管办法》（海关总署令第219号），企业申报的单耗应真实、准确；实际单耗超过行业单耗标准的，需提供工艺说明、实测数据等材料证明合理性，由海关审核认可后方可按实际核销（具体口径以主管海关为准，各地执行存在差异）。</p>\n<p>这决定了企业的自查动作应当<strong>跑在稽查之前</strong>。一份可用的损耗率自查清单至少覆盖以下几点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>勾稽一致性</strong>：备案单耗、ERP 领料、实际进出口三者能否对平；不能对平的项号逐项列出原因。</li>\n<li><strong>容差合规性</strong>：当前生效的容差是否与最新的行业单耗标准一致；有无失效容差仍在被引用。</li>\n<li><strong>异常闭环率</strong>：历史异常中，已闭环处置的比例；未闭环的异常是否还挂在待办里。</li>\n<li><strong>证据可复现性</strong>：随机抽取若干异常，能否从原始工单复现当时的判定与结论。</li>\n<li><strong>版本一致性</strong>：单耗版本、容差版本、处置记录的版本是否自洽，有无「新单耗配旧证据」的错配。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个常被忽略的自查点是<strong>跨手册串料</strong>。同一批料件在手册 A 记损耗、在手册 B 记结余，单看每本手册损耗率都可能正常，合起来才暴露缺口。因此稽核的统计口径不能只按手册切片，还要按<strong>料件项号</strong>做跨手册汇总，这是「数据事实」类异常最隐蔽的一种，也最难在单手册视角下发现。识别这类异常需要把损耗率样本按料件项号重新聚合，再比对聚合后的总量与保税进口总量——本质上是一次料件维度而非手册维度的对账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>损耗率异常识别的成败，不在于用了多复杂的算法，而在于先把「什么算异常」定义清楚：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>先分类再判定</strong>——把变异分为随机、漂移、跳变、口径四类，前三类是工艺事实、第四类是数据事实，混同处理是核销缺口集中爆发的根因；</li>\n<li><strong>方法随数据密度选</strong>——数据稀疏用相对偏差，数据密集用控制图 + CUSUM，其中 CUSUM 专治阈值告警看不见的缓慢漂移；</li>\n<li><strong>容差分三层嵌套</strong>——工艺容差惊动产线、内控容差惊动关务、合规容差触发举证，容差必须可溯源、可版本化，禁止硬编码；</li>\n<li><strong>处置即造证据</strong>——每次异常处置的原始数据、基线容差版本、结论材料都要与单耗版本绑定，稽查问的从来不是数字本身，而是数字能否复现。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>闭环建起来后，损耗率就从「报核时才核对的事后指标」，变成一条<strong>在异常当刻即可拦截并解释的运行数据</strong>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"损耗率异常的识别与偏差容差稽核","id":"损耗率异常的识别与偏差容差稽核"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：损耗率波动的三类变异来源","id":"核心概念-损耗率波动的三类变异来源"},{"level":2,"text":"异常识别的统计工具：从阈值告警到控制图","id":"异常识别的统计工具-从阈值告警到控制图"},{"level":2,"text":"偏差容差的三层设定与稽核判定","id":"偏差容差的三层设定与稽核判定"},{"level":2,"text":"异常处置与证据链：四条处置路径","id":"异常处置与证据链-四条处置路径"},{"level":2,"text":"与海关稽查的对接与自查","id":"与海关稽查的对接与自查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"单耗备案、申报口径与行业单耗标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/processing-trade-bonded-manual-bom/unit-consumption-loss/unit-consumption-filing-standard-declare"},"next":{"title":"报核周期与核销数据准备（报关单归集与配平）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/processing-trade-bonded-manual-bom/manual-writeoff-audit/writeoff-cycle-data-preparation"}}